<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>通知悬浮气泡</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>通知悬浮气泡 · 测试版 0.4.1</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>点击时立即执行通知或 App 打开动作，同时伸出图标。通知按新到旧依次打开；没有待打开的通知时通过 TrollOpen 1.5.2 隐根版分屏打开 App。长按约 0.6 秒关闭图标，保留气泡破裂动画。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用悬浮气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示位置</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>锁屏关闭仅隐藏气泡，通知仍会收集，进入允许显示的桌面或 App 后出现。总开关关闭会清理全部图标。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>锁屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnLock</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>主屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnHome</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>App 内显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowInApps</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标外观</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>大小范围 32–80 点，默认 48 点；不透明度范围 20%–100%，越低越透明。修改即时生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标大小</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconSize</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>48</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>32</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标不透明度</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconOpacity</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.2</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>气泡与角标</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>伸出和缩回均为 0.6 秒，完整伸出后停留 2 秒。新通知图标动画移到第一位。切换器 App 也显示图标；上划关闭卡片时清理对应图标，清空切换器时依次破裂。角标跟随桌面。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清除全部气泡</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>clearBubbles</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
